            "review_title": "Review at Phuong Kieu Kieu",
            "review_text": "Erik\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam29 contributions\n0\nGreat seafood with a smile, and very cheap!\nMay 2015 • Couples\nMy (Vietnamese) girlfriend spotted the restaurant while on our way to another place to have lunch. We decided to go back there for dinner, which ended being our best decision of the day! Amazing snails and mussels prepared in different ways, super friendly service, and all that for a very good price - we had 4 plates of delicious food, 2 cokes and (free) tra da + refills for $9!\n\nI am not sure if they speak any English though, as my girlfriend did all the ordering. But I'm sure with some pointing, you should be able to get yourself some satisfying food.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten May 3, 2015",
